msgstr "Import a profile (JSON)"

msgid "plugins.generic.conferenceManager.institution.import.description"
msgstr "Paste JSON exported from another context and save the form. Signers and accounts from the file replace the current ones; the logo and seal stay unchanged. Other fields of the form are ignored on import."

